<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN PGA THIRD ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-SOUTH AFRICAN PGA THIRD ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores from the</p>
<p>third round of the 2.15 million rand (480,000 dollar) South</p>
<p>African PGA Championship at par 72 Houghton Golf Club on</p>
<p>Saturday (South African unless stated):</p>
<p>198 David Frost 69 63 66</p>
<p>201 Katsuyoshi Tomori (Japan) 67 67 67, Retief Goosen 65 66 70</p>
<p>202 Massimo Scarpa (Italy) 65 68 69, Nico van Rensburg 68 68 66</p>
<p>203 Niclas Fasth (Sweden) 66 69 68, Nick Price (Zimbabwe) 67 66</p>
<p>70, Thomas Gogele (Germany) 64 68 71</p>
<p>204 Brad Ott (U.S.) 68 69 67, Marco Gortana 70 67 67, Craig</p>
<p>Kamps 68 68 68, Max Anglert (Sweden) 68 67 69, Mark Murless</p>
<p>66</p>
<p>69 69</p>
<p>205 Greg Petersen (U.S.) 71 69 65, Ignacio Garrido (Spain) 69</p>
<p>69</p>
<p>67, Sven Struver (Germany) 71 69 65, Mark McNulty</p>
<p>(Zimbabwe) 69</p>
<p>69 67, Wayne Westner 68 66 71</p>
<p>206 Tony Johnstone (Zimbabwe) 70 69 67, Ian Hutchings 67 71 68,</p>
<p>Ashley Roestoff 67 70 69, Bob May (U.S.) 66 68 72, Gary</p>
<p>Emerson</p>
<p>(Britain) 67 67 72</p>
</text>
